abstract: >-
  Tooling that runs Epic Games' City Sample (Unreal Engine 5.8) as a CARLA
  0.10.0 driving simulator, and extracts the city's road network as ASAM
  OpenDRIVE so it can be driven in any CARLA. Includes an Unreal plugin that
  exports Epic's ZoneGraph, converters that produce OpenDRIVE with traffic
  lights, stop signs and crosswalks, a bridge that makes Epic's Mass ECS
  traffic and crowd visible to the CARLA API, a semantic tagger for geometry
  streamed through FastGeoStreaming, and a pedestrian navmesh builder. No Epic
  Games content is redistributed.
